## Feature summary (web, SideFX reference)

- Source: https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/nodes/cop/vdbreshape.html
- Summary (EN): Rebuilds a VDB so its activation follows another VDB's topology. The original values are kept while the reference's active shape is adopted. Output: reshape.
- Résumé (FR) : Recopie la forme d'activation d'un VDB de référence sur un VDB source en gardant ses valeurs ; les voxels nouvellement activés valent zéro.

- Inputs meaning: ["source: the VDB to reshape", "ref: the reference VDB whose activation shape is copied"]

- Key parameters: ["The page has a Parameters heading but lists no parameters"]

- Caveats: ["Newly activated voxels are zero: any voxel the reference activates that the source did not has a value of zero"]

